    {
      "text": "CHARACTER VARIETIES FOR SL(3, C): THE FIGURE EIGHT KNOT — We give a description of several representation varieties of the fundamental group of the complement of the ﬁgure eight knot in PGL(3, C) or\n\n**CHARACTER VARIETIES FOR SL(3, C): THE FIGURE EIGHT KNOT**\n\n*E. FALBEL, A. GUILLOUX, P.-V. KOSELEFF*\n\n29 pp, 25 sections.\n\n**Abstract.** We give a description of several representation varieties of the fundamental group of the complement of the ﬁgure eight knot in PGL(3, C) or PSL(3, C). We obtain a description of the projection of the representation variety into the character variety of the boundary torus into SL(3, C).\n\n**Outline.** Front matter; Introduction; 1 Representation spaces; 1.1 Representation variety and character varie; 1.2 Decorated versions; 1.3 Peripheral representations: choosing a mer; 1.4 Deformation variety; 1.5 A diagram; 1.6 The A-variety; 2 The figure eight knot complement; 2.1 Triangulation; 2.2 Presentations; 3 The deformation variety for the figure eight; 3.1 Computational tools; 3.2 An algebraic representation of Defor ( M, ; 3.3 Overview of the computations.; 3.4 Explicit computations for the Figure Eight; 4 Eigenvalues of peripheral representations",
